  "instructions": [
    "Heat the copper pot over medium heat and add the olive oil.",
    "Add the sliced onion and sauté until translucent, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Stir in the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Mix in the tomato paste and diced tomatoes, cooking for 2 minutes to blend flavors.",
    "Add the sliced sweet red peppers, ground cumin, coriander, smoked paprika, and cinnamon; stir well.",
    "Pour in the water or broth, bring the mixture to a gentle simmer, and cover the pot.",
    "Let the stew cook for 20 minutes, stirring occasionally, until peppers soften.",
    "Finish with lemon juice, season with salt and pepper to taste, and serve hot."
